@startuml
title GET /api/v1/course/{id}/assessment-history - Get Course Assessment History Flow

start

:Client sends GET /api/v1/course/{id}/assessment-history request;

note right
Optional Query Parameters:
- page: int
- pageSize: int
end note

:JWT Authentication Middleware validates access token;

if (JWT token valid?) then (Yes)

    :Request reaches CourseController;

    :Controller validates parameters;

    if (Validation failed?) then (Yes)
        :Return 400 Bad Request;
        stop
    endif

    :Controller forwards request to Mediator;

    :Mediator sends GetCourseAssessmentHistoryQuery to Handler;

    :Handler calls CourseService;

    :CourseService retrieves paginated assessment history;

    :Handler maps history to AssessmentHistoryDto;

    :Controller returns 200 OK with paginated history;

else (No)

    :Return 401 Unauthorized;

endif

stop

@enduml
